  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Actions print contract print attestation phase 1 print attestation phase 1 (empty) print attestation phase 4 print attestation phase 4 (empty) course transfer delete course Vishnu Garigipati Course Info Course Automobile Location Kirkland Start Date Jul 31, 2025 Contract No 1235563 edit Attestation No 03277309 Attestation Date Class 5 Learner's License G621928040207 Issue Date of Class 5 Nov 30, 2020 On-road Instructor Peter Armand Passed SAAQ Knowledge Test? no edit Personal Info Garigipati, Vishnu 6 Rue Yuile, kirkland, QC H9H 5K6 Apr 28, 2002 English vishnucanada@gmail.com 514-641-0366 (cell) 514-566-1791 (home) edit Office Use Only - Notes Transfer student from Wendy's. Student came in to register, but did not have his attestation. I explained that we needed the attestation so we could know exactly where he was in his driving course. He said he tried going in person but the doors were locked \"I've tried calling, and no answer. I even went to their locations but no one is there - the building is empty\". He said he would try another Wendy's location and see if he could obtain his attestation. If not, the student has agreed to start the course from Phase 2. -Anika/ Aug 20th. 7-8 with Miguel Oct 4th 2025 9-10 with Miguel Oct 7th 2025 In car 9-10 booked with Peter on Nov 26th In car 12-13 booked with Peter for Feb 20/26 Ilan. 3/Feb/26 Save Cancel edit To Do (Instructor) sign in for practical lesson #11 sign in for practical lesson #12 Up Next attendPractical_11 0 attendPractical_12 0 Module History in-Car 5 Sep 17, 2025 3:00pm-4:00pm time student instructo